    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Ref stewardship — one ref, many writers, one steward",
      "prov:value": "There is no central table: `special-branches.json`\nwas removed on 2026-10-05 (owner).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-05"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "A window is NOT a hold, and the difference is what ends it",
      "prov:value": "A hold whose reason you cannot restate from current facts is a habit,\nand the measured case cost four clean PRs roughly forty minutes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Coalesce into one write per window",
      "prov:value": "**Composition is only sound when the writes do not contend**, and for a\nroute-keyed store they do not: `branch-store`'s `keyedBy: \"route\"` gives each\nroute one owning generator, so *\"nobody authored either side, so the newer\ngeneration wins\"* (bean `1j3q`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 1j3q"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "Why a GitHub concurrency group is not a window",
      "prov:value": "**Measured here, 2026-09-19** (the comment lives in\n`.github/workflows/feature-staging.yml`): `cancel-in-progress: false` governs\nthe RUNNING job, not the pending one, and **GitHub cancels a PENDING job when a\nnewer one queues for the same group.** Three staging runs from three different\nbranches inside 17 seconds gave two cancelled and one run.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-19"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Why a GitHub concurrency group is not a window",
      "prov:value": "This is the measurement that moved the `gh-pages` fix from a workflow policy to\na steward (bean `xp5j`): the published site was up to **396.2 minutes** behind\n`main` across a streak of **24** consecutive cancellations, and no concurrency\nsetting can coalesce the bursts that caused it.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean xp5j"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The two gaps a steward reports rather than fixes",
      "prov:value": "Measured on `gh-pages`, 2026-10-04: its `writers` list held **4**, and parsing\nall 35 workflows found **5** — `publish.yml` defaults `publish_branch:\ngh-pages` and was unlisted.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The two gaps a steward reports rather than fixes",
      "prov:value": "And a sweep **prints its denominator**\n([`generalise-the-fix`](generalise-the-fix.md) §1.2a): the first pass over\nthose workflows reported 6 producers because `'gh-pages' in text` matched a\ncomment in `merge-main.yml`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What this does not do yet",
      "prov:value": "- **No steward runs over `gh-pages`.** The ref is declared, and bean `xp5j`\n  carries the migration; until the five producers write through\n  `branch-store`'s route keying there is no window to hold.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean xp5j"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/ref-stewardship.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What this does not do yet",
      "prov:value": "- **No steward runs over the `cat/cat-harness/*` refs.** They are seeded and\n  declared and, per their declarations, *\"not authoritative\"* until arc\n  `fs43`'s flip."
    }
  ]
}
